## Posting rules of thumb
- Put the main keyword in the pin title, the description and the first line of text on the image.
- Keep important text out of the bottom third (it can be cropped).
- Post each pin to the **most relevant board first**, then to one or two secondary boards after a few days.
- Use **fresh pins** (new image or headline) instead of re-uploading the same image.
- Check **Pinterest Analytics** after 2 weeks: keep the pins with the most outbound clicks and make variations of them.
- Always disclose affiliate links; never post the identical pin repeatedly (looks like spam).

## Tracking
Record pin titles + dates in the MoneyHub dashboard so you can see which angle brings sales.
